            "InlineFormula", ExpressionUUID -> 
             "144a1d2c-f403-4427-8cd7-ac5c5313b124"], " partitions the CSR in \
an adaptive way to achieve an optimal slicing status, according to the given \
leads' configuration, where ", Cell[BoxData[StyleBox["ptsleads", "TI"]], 
            "InlineFormula", ExpressionUUID -> 
             "d8d6c582-a3fb-4ca4-870b-5505b3a0fbda"], 
           " are the points in all the 1st cells of every lead, ", 
