           " are the points in CSR, and ", Cell[BoxData[SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["d", "TI"], "up"]], "InlineFormula", 
            ExpressionUUID -> "f25be20a-ec86-423a-9023-580ab50c3baa"], 
           " is the upper limit of distance under consideration."}], 
